    "Initial validation corrected a component namespace import and test fixtures for valid retention timestamps and empty TAR entries.",
    "A real export bug treated internally copied files as incomplete; file inclusion and manifest tests caught it, and the internal status mapping was corrected.",
    "The final review added no-follow traversal for backup root ancestors and portable archive paths before the final regression and repeated browser qualification.",
    "No package dependency changed. No production data, configuration, credentials, calendar subscriptions or service deployment changed."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Backup-key provisioning, interrupted-workspace cleanup, debug-log cleanup and pre-migration encrypted snapshots remain open.",
    "The portable export is plaintext and intentionally excludes authentication state; it is not accepted by the encrypted restore command.",
    "Root paths must be canonical directories without symbolic-link ancestors.",
    "Full daemon backup/restore under sustained edits, external mount-point qualification, large-corpus resource checks and hardened deployment remain required.",
    "The remaining enrichment/provider and release acceptance gates in the M4 plan remain open."
  ]
